5,1,1,talk,Minato,,I am curious about the ground. It feels important to know what is under our feet before we start digging.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,May,,Hello everyone. I am here to look at the numbers. I want to see what this place will cost us later.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"Good morning, dear. I have seen many plans come and go. I would like to see what the old ones look like now.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I am thinking about who will actually do the work. The staff numbers seem to be changing quite a bit.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"The park is used every day. I need to know how people actually move through it, not just how it looks on paper.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Minato,,"@May, do you think the cost is the only thing that matters? The ground might be tricky too.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,May,,"@Minato, cost is always a factor. But I am sure the ground is important. Let us see what we find.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shizue,,I agree with Minato. The ground is tricky. But I also worry about the people who will use it.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"I am looking at the staffing. If we do not have enough people, the plan will fail.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"I am looking at the traffic. If people cannot get through, the plan is useless.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Minato,,I will look at the firms. I want to know who can do the work and if the ground is safe.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,May,,I will look at the upkeep ledger. I want to see how much it costs to keep the park nice.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I will look at the condition of the old works. I want to see what has lasted and what has not.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Victoria,,I will look at the groundskeeping roll. I want to see who is left to do the work.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I will look at the timed counts. I want to see how people cross the park on weekdays.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Minato,,I will also look at the depot notes. I want to know if we can keep the park open while we work.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,May,,I will also look at the habitat fund terms. I want to see what the money can and cannot buy.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Shizue,,I will also look at the eastern avenue planting. I want to see if the trees survived.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Victoria,,I will also look at the volunteer groups. I want to see if there is help available.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,I will also look at the drainage callouts. I want to see how the water behaves after rain.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
