35,2,1,talk,Minato,,I found that only two firms can do the big digging. They are worried about the clay.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,May,,I found that the upkeep for planted ground is three times more than hard surfaces. That is a lot.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"I found that the old basin is fine, but the apron outside the hall has been patched three times.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Victoria,,I found that the groundskeeping staff has dropped from eighteen to seven. We are buying in the specialist work.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,I found that most people cross on firm ground. The drainage callouts have doubled since the culvert was capped.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Minato,,"@May, if the upkeep is so high, can we afford the planted options?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,May,,"@Minato, that is exactly my worry. The habitat fund only pays for planting and water, not surfaces.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Victoria, if the staff is so low, how will we keep the park clean?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Shizue, we have volunteer groups. One works on habitat, one on the youth grounds.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Minato, the clay is a problem. But the phasing notes say we can hoard the south side.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Minato,,I am glad we can keep the south open. But the clay is still a risk.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,May,,The fund terms are strict. We cannot use the money for buildings or paving.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Shizue,,The trees on the avenue died because no one watered them. We need to plan for aftercare.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Victoria,,"The volunteers are helpful, but they are not a full-time staff. We need to be realistic.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,The heat readings are high. The drainage is failing. We need a plan that handles water well.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Minato,,I think we need to be careful with the earth-moving. The firms are worried.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,May,,I think we need to look at the long-term costs. The upkeep is a big part of that.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Shizue,,I think we need to learn from the past. The old works show what works and what does not.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Victoria,,I think we need to rely on the volunteers and the bought-in services. We have to make it work.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,I think we need to respect the way people use the park. The counts show they want firm ground.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
