60,3,1,talk,Minato,,"The candidates are A, B, C, and D. I am worried about the ground for A and D.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,May,,I am worried about the cost of A and D. The upkeep is high for planted and water ground.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Shizue,,I am worried about the maintenance of A and D. The trees died before. The water needs care.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Victoria,,I am worried about the staffing for A and D. We do not have enough people to look after them.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,I am worried about the drainage for D. The callouts are already high.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Minato,,"@May, what about B and C? They have hard surfaces.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,May,,"@Minato, B and C are cheaper to maintain. But the fund only pays for planting and water.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Victoria, what about the volunteers? Can they help with B and C?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Shizue, the volunteers are good for habitat and youth sports. B and C need different skills.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Minato, B and C are good for the people who cross on firm ground.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Minato,,I think C is good. It has firm ground and the volunteers can help with the sports.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,May,,I think C is good. It is cheaper to maintain than A and D.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Shizue,,I think C is good. It is simple and the volunteers can help.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Victoria,,I think C is good. The volunteers are already working on the youth grounds.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Shunichi,,I think C is good. It respects the way people use the park.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Minato,,I agree with C. It is practical and the ground is safe.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,May,,I agree with C. It is affordable and the fund can cover some of the planting.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Shizue,,I agree with C. It is simple and the volunteers can help.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Victoria,,I agree with C. It is realistic and the volunteers are already there.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Shunichi,,I agree with C. It works with the way people use the park.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
